  "description": "Jack The Mouse: A New Graffiti Font\nInject your designs with raw, urban energy using Jack The Mouse, a bold graffiti display font built for maximum attitude. This typeface features heavy, expressive letterforms characterized by a rhythmic “hand-tag” flow and authentic paint-drip accents. Its solid visual weight and gritty, stippled internal texture provide a sophisticated yet approachable street-art aesthetic, making it an extraordinary choice for modern streetwear branding, edgy editorial headers, skate-culture graphics, and high-impact social media content. Jack The Mouse delivers a sense of handcrafted power and unyielding creative character to your visual identity, ensuring your message makes its mark with a legendary and unforgettable personality.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Jack The Mouse: A New Graffiti Font</p>\n<p>Inject your designs with raw, urban energy using Jack The Mouse, a bold graffiti display font built for maximum attitude. This typeface features heavy, expressive letterforms characterized by a rhythmic “hand-tag” flow and authentic paint-drip accents. Its solid visual weight and gritty, stippled internal texture provide a sophisticated yet approachable street-art aesthetic, making it an extraordinary choice for modern streetwear branding, edgy editorial headers, skate-culture graphics, and high-impact social media content. Jack The Mouse delivers a sense of handcrafted power and unyielding creative character to your visual identity, ensuring your message makes its mark with a legendary and unforgettable personality.</p>",
